iends, the cowherds, were given life when Krishna appeared from the Yamuna, and\nhow Krishna protected the sleeping inhabitants of Vraja by stopping the fire of the forest. In the eighteenth chapter, there are 32 verses in which Krishna and Balarama's forest excursion, in Vrindavan during summer"
